{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Shepherd</b> — Because Jacob mentioned in his blessings: משם רועה אבן ישראל (from there the shepherd of the stone of Israel) regarding Joseph, therefore he leads Joseph like a flock." "<b>Enthroned upon the cherubim</b> — Because the ark was at first in the territory of Joseph and afterward in the territory of Benjamin, and both are sons of Rachel, in the reckoning of Jacob's first wife, and thus it is written: בני רחל אשת יעקב (the sons of Rachel, wife of Jacob); therefore: רחל מבכה על בניה (Rachel weeps over her children), and all Israel are called by the name Ephraim, and this is: ויקרא בהם שמי (and He calls My name upon them) — or the psalmist mentions a war that befell the sons of Rachel with the nations."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 80, :notes {1 "The phrase 'במחשבת בני יעקב הראשונה מנשיו' is parsed as 'in the reckoning of the sons of Jacob's first wife among his wives'; the syntax is compressed and slightly awkward."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:35:32.024213575Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}